# Don't stop here, keep learning!

## Additional Resources
* <a href="https://www.teachai.org/" target="_blank">TeachAI.org</a> Empowering educators to teach with and about AI.
* <a href="https://www.teachai.org/ailiteracy" target="_blank">AILit Framework</a> from TeachAI.org.
* <a href="https://quickdraw.withgoogle.com/" target="_blank">Quick, Draw with Google</a> a quick and fun AI-powered game.
* <a href="https://www.khanmigo.ai/" target="_blank">Khanmigo</a> Khanacademy’s on-demand AI-powered support for education.
* <a href="https://labs.google/" target="_blank">Labs.Google</a> Google’s home for the latest AI tools, technology and discourse.


## Take it Further Activities

Want to learn more? Try out the following optional activities.
  <!-- Dropdown 1 -->
<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">

<summary style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold">
	Learn More About AI
</summary>

<div style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
<p style="margin: 5px 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">A TED Talk is a short, powerful presentation, typically 18 minutes or less, given by experts on a wide range of topics including technology, entertainment, and design, aimed at spreading innovative ideas and sparking discussion. <br> Learn some more about AI on your own. Watch one or more AI-themed Ted Talks. 
</p>

<a href="https://www.ted.com/playlists/310/artificial_intelligence" 
         target="blank" 
         rel="noopener noreferrer" 
         style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 5px; padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #026C7A; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px;">Check it Out
</a>
</div>

</details>

  <!-- Dropdown 2 -->
<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">

<summary style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold">
	AI Literacy Activities for the Classroom
</summary>

<div style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
<p style="margin: 5px 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">TeachAI.org has ready-to-use AI Literacy focused activity ideas for every subject. Designed to fit into a 40-minute class with almost no prep required.<br> Review these activities and choose one to implement in your classroom.
</p>

<a href="https://www.teachai.org/media/learningscenarios_deck_final-j9gmue" 
